    "Week": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uge"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly digest": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ugentlig oversigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What arrdeck pushes to the browsers subscribed to it. This app cannot receive web push itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad arrdeck sender til de browsere, der abonnerer. Denne app kan ikke selv modtage web push."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What arrived this week and what is coming up next week. Switch the Weekly digest event off to stop it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad der kom i denne uge, og hvad der kommer i næste uge. Slå hændelsen Ugentlig oversigt fra for at stoppe den."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What could go to free space. Tick what to remove; nothing is deleted until you confirm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad der kan fjernes for at frigøre plads. Markér det, der skal væk; intet slettes, før du bekræfter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the torrent clients are downloading, as of arrdeck's last refresh.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad torrentklienterne downloader, ifølge arrdecks seneste opdatering."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's downloading": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad downloades"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's on today": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvad kommer der i dag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, the rules below are checked once a day. A title that matches is marked as leaving, shown in Plex in a “Leaving soon” collection, and announced by a push notification (the Cleanup event). When its grace period is over it is checked again with fresh data, and only if it still matches are its files deleted through Radarr or Sonarr, which also keep it off their import lists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Når den er slået til, tjekkes reglerne nedenfor én gang om dagen. En titel, der matcher, markeres som på vej ud, vises i Plex i samlingen “Forsvinder snart” og meldes med en push-notifikation (hændelsen Oprydning). Når fristen er gået, tjekkes den igen med friske data, og kun hvis den stadig matcher, slettes dens filer via Radarr eller Sonarr, som også holder den ude af deres importlister."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where arrdeck finds each service. Changing these affects every screen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvor arrdeck finder hver tjeneste. Ændringer her påvirker alle skærme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While arrdeck is open and something is downloading, its progress shows on the Lock Screen and in the Dynamic Island. Set on this device only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mens arrdeck er åben, og noget downloader, vises fremskridtet på låseskærmen og i Dynamic Island. Gælder kun denne enhed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who watched": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hvem så"
          }
        }
      }
    },
